# First run: the user ID opens on the digits, the computer route is named,
# and Check again answers when no ID has arrived.
wait-for Connect Zotero
expect kobo connect zotero-reader
expect Zotero user ID
expect Step 1 of 3
clean
shot stacks-setup
tap Check again
wait-for No user ID has arrived
clean
shot stacks-check-again
tap Use phone
wait-for zotero.org/settings/keys
clean
shot stacks-phone
tap Back
wait-for Zotero user ID
tap-id zotero-user-id
type 475425
expect 475425
clean
shot stacks-user-id-typed
# The user ID leads to the key, typed hidden and counted.
tap Continue
wait-for Step 2 of 3
expect Account key
expect Use computer
clean
shot stacks-key-step
tap-id credential.enter
wait-idle
type abc
expect 3 characters entered
expect-missing abc
# Saved with the reader offline, the last step says so over the
# collection list rather than waiting for ever.
scenario offline
tap Save
wait 15000
wait-for Step 3 of 3
expect not on Wi-Fi
expect Try again
clean
shot stacks-collections-offline
